1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,540
Still love you silently. Even when there are no words left to say, my love for you hasn't faded.

2
00:00:07,680 --> 00:00:13,500
Not everything I feel needs to be spoken. Some love is felt more deeply than it's said.

3
00:00:14,340 --> 00:00:19,940
You're still present in the quietest parts of my days, and my heart is still choosing you in silence.
